== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @brown sugar{2/5%tbsp}, @gluten-free vegetable stock{2/5%cup}, @jackfruit{3/10%kg}, @gluten-free BBQ sauce{1/10%cup}, @paprika{1/5%tsp}, @sesame oil{2/5%tbsp}, @onion{1/5}, @chilli powder{1/10%tsp}, @pepper{1/40%tsp}, @garlic powder{1/5%tsp}, @salt{1/20%tsp}.

